sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Recovering node A
    participant B as Connected peer B
    Note over A,B: A missed an operation
    A->>B: Reconnect and complete handshake
    loop Each anti-entropy interval
        A->>B: PullSince(None)
        B->>B: Read retained op log
        B-->>A: PushOps with retained operations
        A->>A: Persist unseen ops
    end
    Note over A,B: Expired history needs another repair path
